<title>UK: Credit Local adds 25 mln euros to July 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>Credit Local adds 25 mln euros to July 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 125 nln euros from 100 million euros joint lead managers BIL and CCB said.</p>
<p>There is a new issue price of 101.30.</p>
<p>BORROWER   CRDIT LOCAL DE FRANCE</p>
<p>AMT    125 MLN EURO  COUPON     5.375     MATURITY    02.JUL.03</p>
<p>TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.30    PAY DATE    02.JUL.97</p>
<p>FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p>MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AA+   DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p>NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p>GOV LAW    LUX	 MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC   1.75</p>
<p>NOTES	LAUNCHED 0RIGINALLY FOR 100 MLN EURO ON 21.MAY.97</p>
<p>	     ALL MONETARY RIGHTS AND OBLIGATIONS IN RESPECT OF THE</p>
<p>NOTES SHALL BE DEEMED IN ECU AT THE RATE OF ONE ECU FOR ONE EURO.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
